<title>SWEDEN: Saab '96 car sales fall slightly.</title>
<headline>Saab '96 car sales fall slightly.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish vehicle maker Saab Automobile AB said on Friday its total car sales fell marginally in 1996 to 98,036 from 98,713 a year earlier.</p>
</text>
